        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as Customer\n    participant S as System\n    participant D as Database\n\n    activate C\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: 1. Submit Sales Order\n    activate S\n    S-&gt;&gt;D: 1.1 Check Catalogue &amp; Pricing\n    activate D\n    D--&gt;&gt;S: 1.2 Book &amp; Price Data\n    deactivate D\n\n    alt Item not supplied or pricing incorrect\n        S--&gt;&gt;C: 2. Reject Order (reason)\n    else Order valid\n        S-&gt;&gt;D: 3. Check Quantity on Hand\n        activate D\n        D--&gt;&gt;S: 3.1 Stock Levels\n        deactivate D\n\n        alt Stock insufficient\n            S-&gt;&gt;D: 4. Raise Purchase Requisition (by Publisher)\n            activate D\n            D--&gt;&gt;S: 4.1 Requisition Saved\n            deactivate D\n            S--&gt;&gt;C: 4.2 Order Acknowledged (Awaiting Stock)\n        else Stock sufficient\n            S-&gt;&gt;D: 5. Save Validated Order\n            activate D\n            D--&gt;&gt;S: 5.1 Order Saved\n            deactivate D\n            S-&gt;&gt;S: 5.2 Calculate Extended Price &amp; Order Total\n            S--&gt;&gt;C: 6. Sales Order Acknowledgement\n        end\n    end\n    deactivate S\n    deactivate C\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="32">
